<title>MOROCCO: TENNIS-GRAND PRIX HASSAN II QUARTER FINALS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAND PRIX HASSAN II QUARTER FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finalts in the Hassan II Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1- Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Fernando Vicente (Spain) 6-7 (3-7) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Franco Squillari(Argentina) beat Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>4-Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat 6-Tomas Carbonell(Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>2-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat 8-Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-2 6-1.</p>
</text>
